# ccbit error-signature dictionary (v2, tier-2 diagnosis) — user-editable.
# Format: one rule per line —  <regex><TAB><one-line remedy>
# On a build/test failure, ccbit greps the error text against each pattern (first match wins)
# and surfaces the remedy on Line 1. Unknown errors fall back to the generic "build failed".
# This file is NOT consumed by v1 (exit-code only); it is the seed for §10.2.
#
# Examples (uncomment / edit for your environment):
# (?i)codeartifact.*(401|unauthor|forbidden)	renew AWS SSO for codeartifact
# (?i)nuget.*(401|restore failed|unable to load the service index)	re-auth NuGet feed
# (?i)connection refused.*:5432	start the local Postgres container
